                    {
                      "id": "346345f5-15db-4cf2-926a-128f17cbbd21",
                      "text": "文档: Addition of natural numbers, typically used via the `+` operator. This function…",
                      "children": [],
                      "isExpanded": true,
                      "parentId": "b50de081-5545-4af9-a093-5640eed29c00",
                      "data": {
                        "note": "**文档**\n\nAddition of natural numbers, typically used via the `+` operator.\n\nThis function is overridden in both the kernel and the compiler to efficiently evaluate using the\narbitrary-precision arithmetic library. The definition provided here is the logical model.",
                        "tags": [
