                        {
                          "id": "9f85b67e-0fc1-4095-8baf-6262851c5a1a",
                          "text": "文档: `Eq.refl a : a = a` is reflexivity, the unique constructor of the equality type…",
                          "children": [],
                          "isExpanded": true,
                          "parentId": "341b44a0-ff75-4992-9d10-8abf4ab06ea1",
                          "data": {
                            "note": "**文档**\n\n`Eq.refl a : a = a` is reflexivity, the unique constructor of the\nequality type. See also `rfl`, which is usually used instead.",
                            "tags": [
                              "attribute",
                              "文档"
                            ]
